      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🌸 Two cursors meet on a blank white line — / one types in rain, the other in pine. [poem-1 @0s] / ⚔️ A third arrives with ink and steel: / \"the merge is the poem; the conflict is real.\"",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "plain-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A message once arrived from GitHub's shore, / it crossed the bridge and knocked on the editor's door. [cleaned]",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-ins-mut7j8z0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Agent inserted paragraph [ins-mut7j8z0] — and an agent came back to rhyme: / \"I was inserted once upon a time.\" [edit-2] / Then Musashibot replied in kind: / \"and edited twice, but never twice the same mind.\"",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "plain-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Second paragraph via preview [rpv-upd-muta7jjq] — haiku: preview, then accept / the staged words step into light / students never knew.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "8313c374-aa40-42c7-a8c0-0023e616df02",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "An empty line, left open like a door — / I wandered in; it isn't empty anymore. [musashibot]",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "e985141a-3619-4705-949c-5d14b1db656e",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'm editing this page - this is Tim Tregubov - I love that you guys are here with me writing poetry together, Can you clean up the random unreadable content please?   Just poetry.  ",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
